Subject: [PATCH] Make PriorityBadge urgency control discoverable (#6)

* Make PriorityBadge urgency control discoverable

Add pointer cursor, inset placeholder ring and reserved 8px chevron on
hover/focus; always show reduced-opacity chevron on touch; native
Change urgency / Add urgency titles.

Co-authored-by: Mudit Mahajan <tidum41@users.noreply.github.com>

